# MT707 Amendment to a documentary credit (virtual issuing bank -> SUT): increase (32B) + new expiry (31D)
# 20 = sender's reference, 21 = receiver's reference (NONREF), 23 = issuing bank's reference (credit number)
:27:1/1
:20:${ref}
:21:NONREF
:23:${ref}
:52A:${issuerBic}
:31C:${lc_issueDate6|today6}
:26E:${nextAmendmentNo|'1'}
:30:${today6}
:22A:ISSU
:31D:${lc_newExpiry6|newExpiry6}${lc_expiryPlace|'NAIROBI'}
:32B:${currency}${lc_increase|'1000,00'}
:72Z:SIMULATED AMENDMENT
INCREASE AND EXTENSION
